      errors: (array)
      applications: (array)
      text: "(import core @std.core)\n\n(import from @std.core.from)\n\n(import try-from @std.core.try-from)\n\n(def limit i32 10i32)\n\n(defint shape\n  visibility: @public\n  (defn name (value self) str)\n  (defn label (value self) str (shape.name value)))\n\n(deftype celsius (record degrees i32)\n  visibility: @public\n  (defn warmer (value self) self (celsius degrees: limit))\n  (impl shape (defn name (value self) str \"celsius\"))\n  (impl (from i16)\n    (defn convert (value i16) self (celsius degrees: (as i32 (from.convert value)))))\n  (impl (from i8)\n    (defn convert (value i8) self (celsius degrees: (as i32 (from.convert value))))))\n\n(defn describe (value celsius) (option str)\n  visibility: @public\n  (option.some (shape.label (celsius.warmer value))))\n\n(defn parse (text str) (result i32 core.conversion-error) (try-from.convert text))\n\n(defn execute () void void)\n")
